# Server resource pack configuration template

This documents the required property names. Replace both placeholders using the owner-selected ZIP and public HTTPS hosting URL before applying it to the actual server.

```properties
resource-pack=<public HTTPS ZIP URL>
resource-pack-sha1=<SHA-1 of the exact ZIP>
require-resource-pack=true
```

When `require-resource-pack=true`, the joining player must accept the vanilla resource-pack prompt to remain on the server. No selected Contrast SMP pack, HTTPS URL, SHA-1, or server configuration file was present when this template was prepared.
